      "ruleId": "ssc-cb14b0aa-021e-49eb-a25a-79b30cac0a94",
      "title": "Uncontrolled Resource Consumption in com.google.protobuf:protobuf-java",
      "description": "A Affected versions of com.google.protobuf:protobuf-java and com.google.protobuf:protobuf-javalite are vulnerable to Uncontrolled Resource Consumption. The vulnerability stems from a parsing issue in the Message-Type Extensions, affecting certain package versions and allowing for Denial of Service (DoS) attacks through inputs containing multiple instances of non-repeated embedded messages with repeated or unknown fields; exploiting it triggers conversions between mutable and immutable forms, potentially leading to extended garbage collection pauses.",
      "ecosystem": "maven",
      "severity": "HIGH",
