        "message": "A Affected versions of com.google.protobuf:protobuf-java and com.google.protobuf:protobuf-javalite are vulnerable to Uncontrolled Resource Consumption. The vulnerability stems from a parsing issue in the Message-Type Extensions, affecting certain package versions and allowing for Denial of Service (DoS) attacks through inputs containing multiple instances of non-repeated embedded messages with repeated or unknown fields; exploiting it triggers conversions between mutable and immutable forms, potentially leading to extended garbage collection pauses.",
